  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing resilience to climate change of migrant  vulnerable households in the coastal areas India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen rural households&apos; resilience to climate change to both reduce the pressure to migrate out of distress and improve migration outcomes, with particular attention to addressing the vulnerabilities of women and other vulnerable groups (e.g. small and marginal farmers, Scheduled Tribes (ST), Scheduled Caste (SC), Other Backward Castes (OBC) and other marginalised groups) living in the coastal areas of Odisha State and drought-prone areas of Telangana State</narrative>
  </description>
